      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "### This is an example workflow for running the following:\n- FLUX.2 Klein 9B\n- AsyncDiff, 4 GPUs, 4n1s\n- 4-bit quantization with SDNQ on the entire pipeline (except VAE)\n- Running in FP16\n- 512x512 @ 20 steps\n\n\n#### Of course, this is just the basics, and there are more nodes as well.<br>Further tuning for your hardware is required.\n##### Follow this workflow from left-to-right to how each node works."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
