        -650,
        975
      ],
      "size": [
        575,
        450
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 6,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Select the checkpoint here.\nThis scans for folders in the directory \"models/checkpoints\".\nRemember, you need to use full Diffusers checkpoints.\nNote that pipeline .safetensors are not supported.\nYou can get the checkpoint here (use \"git clone\" command in your checkpoints folder):\n- https://huggingface.co/Disty0/FLUX.2-klein-9B-SDNQ-4bit-dynamic-svd-r32\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nYou may also select a transformer/vae/etc. .safetensor using this ModelSelector.\nThis scans for .safetensors in \"models/unet\", \"models/vae\", etc.\nYou will also need to provide a config.json for your model.\n(Usually, reusing the config.json in the checkpoint itself will suffice.)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nIf you wish to use .gguf, .bin, or .ckpt, use this UnsafeModelSelector.\nAs the name implies, this uses models that are not .safetensors.\nAlways investigate non-.safetensor files and use your best judgement before using them.\nAgain, this requires a config.json as well."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
